    {
      "source": "General query method returning typically the repository type, a <code>Collection</code> or <code>Streamable</code> subtype or a result wrapper such as <code>Page</code>, <code>GeoResults</code> or any other store-specific result wrapper. Can be used as <code>findBy…</code>, <code>findMyDomainTypeBy…</code> or in combination with additional keywords.",
      "translation": "通用查询方法，通常返回仓库类型、`Collection` 或 `Streamable` 子类型，或如 `Page`、`GeoResults` 等任何特定存储的结果包装器。可作为 `findBy…`、`findMyDomainTypeBy…` 使用，或与附加关键字组合使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Limit the query results to the first <code>&lt;number&gt;</code> of results. This keyword can occur in any place of the subject between <code>find</code> (and the other keywords) and <code>by</code>.",
      "translation": "将查询结果限制为前 <code>&lt;number&gt;</code> 条。此关键字可出现在主题中 <code>find</code>（及其他关键字）与 <code>by</code> 之间的任何位置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Use a distinct query to return only unique results. Consult the store-specific documentation whether that feature is supported. This keyword can occur in any place of the subject between <code>find</code> (and the other keywords) and <code>by</code>.",
      "translation": "使用独特的查询以仅返回唯一结果。请查阅特定商店的文档，确认是否支持该功能。此关键字可以出现在<code>find</code>（以及其他关键字）和<code>by</code>之间的主体任何位置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following table lists reserved methods that use predefined functionality (as defined in <code>CrudRepository</code>).\nThese methods are directly invoked on the backing (store-specific) implementation of the repository proxy.\nSee also “<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.query-methods.reserved-methods\">Defining Query Methods</a>”.",
      "translation": "下表列出了使用预定义功能（如 <code>CrudRepository</code> 中定义）的保留方法。  \n这些方法直接调用存储库代理的底层（特定于存储的实现）。  \n另请参阅“<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.query-methods.reserved-methods\">定义查询方法</a>\"。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>Is</code>, <code>Equals</code>, (or no keyword)",
      "translation": "<code>是</code>、<code>等于</code>（或无关键字）",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Exists projection, returning typically a <code>boolean</code> result.",
      "translation": "存在投影，通常返回一个 `<code>boolean</code>` 结果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Delete query method returning either no result (<code>void</code>) or the delete count.",
      "translation": "删除查询方法，返回无结果（<code>void</code>）或删除计数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Specify a static sorting order followed by the property path and direction (e.g. <code>OrderByFirstnameAscLastnameDesc</code>).",
      "translation": "指定一个静态排序顺序，后跟属性路径和方向（例如 <code>OrderByFirstnameAscLastnameDesc</code>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following table lists the subject keywords generally supported by the Spring Data repository query derivation mechanism to express the predicate.\nConsult the store-specific documentation for the exact list of supported keywords, because some keywords listed here might not be supported in a particular store.",
      "translation": "下表列出了 Spring Data 存储库查询推导机制通常支持的主键关键字，用于表达谓词。  \n请查阅特定存储的文档以获取确切的支持关键字列表，因为此处列出的一些关键字可能在特定存储中不被支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Count projection returning a numeric result.",
      "translation": "返回数值结果的计数投影。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following table lists the predicate keywords generally supported by the Spring Data repository query derivation mechanism.\nHowever, consult the store-specific documentation for the exact list of supported keywords, because some keywords listed here might not be supported in a particular store.",
      "translation": "下表列出了 Spring Data 存储库查询推导机制通常支持的谓词关键字。  \n然而，请查阅特定存储的文档以获取确切的支持关键字列表，因为此处列出的一些关键字可能在某些存储中不被支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In addition to filter predicates, the following list of modifiers is supported:",
      "translation": "除了过滤谓词外，还支持以下修饰符列表：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Used with a predicate keyword for case-insensitive comparison.",
      "translation": "与谓词关键字配合使用，以实现不区分大小写的比较。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Ignore case for all suitable properties. Used somewhere in the query method predicate.",
      "translation": "忽略所有适用属性的大小写。在查询方法的谓词中使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
